    <bpmn:process id="W_W4962" name="W4962. Will-Call Counter Operations, Order Staging &amp; Customer Identification/Release" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer arrival for pickup; order ready notification (W4966)
Frequency: Per pickup (continuous, 200 stores)
Volume: ~5–8% bulky-pickup share of ~2.8M monthly transactions across 200 stores (~140,000–220,000/month)
Owner: Will-Call Counter Supervisor / Store Ops (VS-07)
Participants: Will-Call Counter Staff, Store Ops (VS-07), CX (VS-13), LP (VS-23)
Source: workflow W4962 — Will-Call Counter Operations, Order Staging &amp; Customer Identification/Release</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4962_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4962_Lane1" name="Counter Staff">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4962_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4962_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4962_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4962_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4962_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4962_Start3" name="Customer arrival for pickup; order ready notification (W4966)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4962_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4962_Task4" name="Identify the customer &amp; verify the order: at the will-call counter, verify…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Identify the customer &amp; verify the order: at the will-call counter, verify customer identity/order (ID + order number — links VS-91 privacy, prevent wrong-customer release), pull the staged order (W4965), and confirm the order/items/condition with the customer before release
Responsible (R): Counter Staff
Accountable (A): Counter Supervisor
Duration: Per pickup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4962_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4962_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4962_Task5" name="Release &amp; document: release the order to the customer, capture the pickup…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Release &amp; document: release the order to the customer, capture the pickup confirmation/signature, update the order status (links VS-10/VS-16 — complete the fulfillment), and hand off to loading (W4970) or carry-out (W4974) for bulky goods
Responsible (R): Counter Staff / Loader
Accountable (A): Counter Supervisor
Duration: Per pickup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4962_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4962_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4962_Task6" name="Manage counter exceptions: missing/incomplete order, wrong item…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage counter exceptions: missing/incomplete order, wrong item, damaged-at-stage, payment/balance due, or identity/ownership dispute; route to resolution (VS-32 returns, VS-13 CX, VS-23 LP) and document
Responsible (R): Counter Staff / CX / LP
Accountable (A): Counter Supervisor / Store Mgr
Duration: Per exception</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4962_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4962_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4962_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4962_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4962_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-743 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Pickup &amp; Will-Call Program Design, Capacity &amp; Scheduling (PA-171.1).) | - CTL-743: ID/order verified before release; release captured; exceptions routed; privacy-compliant (VS-91)
Owner: Will-Call Counter Supervisor / Store Ops (VS-07)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4962_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4962_Annotation8" targetRef="W4962_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4962_Flow10" sourceRef="W4962_Start3" targetRef="W4962_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4962_Flow11" sourceRef="W4962_Task4" targetRef="W4962_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4962_Flow12" sourceRef="W4962_Task5" targetRef="W4962_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4962_Flow13" sourceRef="W4962_Task6" targetRef="W4962_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
