    <bpmn:process id="W_W4964" name="W4964. Loading-Zone Layout, Signage, Wayfinding &amp; Pedestrian/Vehicle Flow" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New store (VS-37); remodel (VS-109); safety/incident (VS-147); flow review
Frequency: Per project + periodic review
Volume: ~1 loading-zone/wayfinding design per store × 200 stores
Owner: Real Estate/Facilities (VS-20/VS-138) / Store Ops / HSE (VS-24)
Participants: Store Ops (VS-07), HSE (VS-24), Real Estate (VS-20), Facilities (VS-138), Customer Safety (VS-147)
Source: workflow W4964 — Loading-Zone Layout, Signage, Wayfinding &amp; Pedestrian/Vehicle Flow</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4964_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4964_Lane1" name="Facilities">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4964_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4964_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4964_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4964_Lane2" name="Store Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4964_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4964_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4964_Start4" name="New store (VS-37); remodel (VS-109); safety/incident (VS-147); flow review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4964_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4964_Task5" name="Design the loading-zone layout: the customer-vehicle lanes, the loading…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Design the loading-zone layout: the customer-vehicle lanes, the loading bay/doors, the staging area, pedestrian walkways, the forklift operating envelope, signage/wayfinding (entry, slot, counter, wait area), and separation of vehicle/pedestrian/forklift flows (links VS-147 premises safety, BP 344 PWD access)
Responsible (R): Facilities / Real Estate / HSE / Store Ops
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations / Facilities
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4964_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4964_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4964_Task6" name="Implement signage, markings &amp; controls: lane/bay markings, directional signage…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Implement signage, markings &amp; controls: lane/bay markings, directional signage, slot/QR signage, pedestrian barriers, mirrors, speed controls, forklift-zone demarcation, and PWD/accessible pickup (links VS-13/RA 7277)
Responsible (R): Facilities / Store Ops / HSE
Accountable (A): Facilities / Store Mgr
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4964_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4964_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4964_Task7" name="Review &amp; maintain: periodic flow/safety review, post-incident review (VS-147)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Review &amp; maintain: periodic flow/safety review, post-incident review (VS-147), maintain signage/markings/barriers, and feed the remodel program (VS-109) and customer-safety CAPA (VS-147)
Responsible (R): Store Ops / HSE / Facilities
Accountable (A): Store Mgr / HSE Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4964_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4964_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4964_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4964_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
