        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-743 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Pickup &amp; Will-Call Program Design, Capacity &amp; Scheduling (PA-171.1).) | - CTL-743: flow separates vehicle/pedestrian/forklift; signage complete; PWD-accessible; HSE-reviewed
Owner: Real Estate/Facilities (VS-20/VS-138) / Store Ops / HSE (VS-24)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
