      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4965_Start3" name="Order placed/ready-for-pickup (VS-10/VS-11); appointment (W4963)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4965_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4965_Task4" name="Pick &amp; pre-stage the order: on order readiness, pick the bulky items…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Pick &amp; pre-stage the order: on order readiness, pick the bulky items (lumber/tile/cement/appliance) from yard/sales-floor/backroom (links VS-07.3 receiving, VS-05 inventory), verify against the order, and stage in the designated staging area tagged to the customer/order/slot
Responsible (R): Staging Lead / Stock Associates
Accountable (A): Staging Lead
Duration: Per order</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4965_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4965_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4965_Task5" name="Verify readiness &amp; condition: confirm completeness (no shorts), condition (no…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Verify readiness &amp; condition: confirm completeness (no shorts), condition (no damage W4979), special-order correctness (VS-09/VS-11), and catch-weight/cut-to-length accuracy (VS-115); flag exceptions before customer arrival
Responsible (R): Staging Lead / Inventory / CX
Accountable (A): Staging Lead
Duration: Per order</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4965_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4965_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4965_Task6" name="Manage the staging area: staging-slot utilization, FIFO/expiry (no stale holds…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage the staging area: staging-slot utilization, FIFO/expiry (no stale holds — links W4978), segregation of customer orders, and feed the readiness notification (W4966) and counter (W4962)
Responsible (R): Staging Lead / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Supervisor
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4965_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4965_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4965_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4965_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
