        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-743 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Pickup &amp; Will-Call Program Design, Capacity &amp; Scheduling (PA-171.1).) | - CTL-743: order verified before staging; completeness/condition checked; staging-slot tracked; readiness SLA
Owner: Staging/Receiving Lead / Store Ops (VS-07)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
