        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-743 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Pickup &amp; Will-Call Program Design, Capacity &amp; Scheduling (PA-171.1).) | - CTL-743: readiness notification sent on SLA; arrival verified; queue managed; privacy-compliant (VS-91)
Owner: Will-Call/Loading-Zone Supervisor / CX (VS-13)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
