    <bpmn:process id="W_W4967" name="W4967. BOPIS / Ecommerce / Special-Order Pickup Integration at the Will-Call Counter" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: BOPIS/ecommerce/special-order placed (VS-10/VS-09/VS-11)
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~BOPIS 42,900 + special-order pickups/month (national) + bulky share
Owner: Will-Call Counter Supervisor / Ecommerce Ops (VS-10) / Store Ops
Participants: Ecommerce (VS-10), Store Ops (VS-07), B2B/Trade (VS-11), Special Orders (VS-09), CX (VS-13)
Source: workflow W4967 — BOPIS / Ecommerce / Special-Order Pickup Integration at the Will-Call Counter</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4967_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4967_Lane1" name="Ecommerce Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4967_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4967_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4967_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4967_Lane2" name="Counter Staff">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4967_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4967_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4967_Start4" name="BOPIS/ecommerce/special-order placed (VS-10/VS-09/VS-11)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4967_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4967_Task5" name="Integrate BOPIS/ecommerce pickup at the will-call counter: the online order…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Integrate BOPIS/ecommerce pickup at the will-call counter: the online order (VS-10 BOPIS) → pick/stage (W4965) → readiness notify (W4966) → counter release (W4962), with mixed-basket/multi-origin orders (links VS-10 W534) reconciled before release
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Ops / Counter Staff / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Supervisor
Duration: Per order</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4967_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4967_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4967_Task6" name="Integrate special-order &amp; B2B/trade pickup: special orders (VS-09 W744/W545…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Integrate special-order &amp; B2B/trade pickup: special orders (VS-09 W744/W545, VS-11 trade) → notify on arrival → counter release with deposit/balance check (links VS-09/VS-11) → bulky loading (W4970); handle project/contractor bulk (VS-11/VS-74)
Responsible (R): Counter Staff / B2B / Special Orders
Accountable (A): Supervisor
Duration: Per order</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4967_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4967_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4967_Task7" name="Reconcile status across channels: ensure order status (paid, staged, released)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Reconcile status across channels: ensure order status (paid, staged, released) is consistent across ecommerce (VS-10), POS (VS-08), order mgmt (VS-16), and the counter; manage cross-channel exceptions (links VS-10/VS-60)
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Ops / IT / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Supervisor
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4967_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4967_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4967_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4967_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4967_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-743 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Pickup &amp; Will-Call Program Design, Capacity &amp; Scheduling (PA-171.1).) | - CTL-743: status real-time across channels; mixed-basket reconciled; balance-due gate enforced
Owner: Will-Call Counter Supervisor / Ecommerce Ops (VS-10) / Store Ops</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
