    <bpmn:process id="W_W4968" name="W4968. Self-Haul Rental (VS-162) &amp; Customer-Hired-Vehicle Pickup Coordination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer rents self-haul vehicle (VS-162) or arrives in own/hired vehicle
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~800–1,200 self-haul rentals + customer-vehicle pickups per month × 200 stores
Owner: Loading-Zone Supervisor / Self-Haul Rental (VS-162) / Store Ops
Participants: Self-Haul Rental (VS-162), Store Ops (VS-07), CX (VS-13), HSE (VS-24)
Source: workflow W4968 — Self-Haul Rental (VS-162) &amp; Customer-Hired-Vehicle Pickup Coordination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4968_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4968_Lane1" name="Self-Haul Rental">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4968_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4968_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4968_Lane2" name="Loading Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4968_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4968_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4968_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4968_Start4" name="Customer rents self-haul vehicle (VS-162) or arrives in own/hired vehicle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4968_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4968_Task5" name="Coordinate the self-haul rental + pickup: when a customer rents a self-haul…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Coordinate the self-haul rental + pickup: when a customer rents a self-haul vehicle (VS-162) or hires transport, link the rental to the order, schedule pickup/loading around the rental window, and stage the order to match the vehicle capacity
Responsible (R): Self-Haul Rental / Loading Supervisor / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Supervisor
Duration: Per pickup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4968_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4968_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4968_Task6" name="Verify vehicle suitability: confirm the customer&#x27;s vehicle (rented/owned/hired)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Verify vehicle suitability: confirm the customer&#x27;s vehicle (rented/owned/hired) can safely carry the load (size/weight/load rating — e.g., lumber length, appliance weight, tile pallet), and offer alternatives (delivery VS-06/VS-143, larger rental VS-162) if not
Responsible (R): Loading Supervisor / CX
Accountable (A): Supervisor
Duration: Per pickup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4968_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4968_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4968_Task7" name="Manage rental-return &amp; handoff: coordinate loading (W4970) within the rental…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage rental-return &amp; handoff: coordinate loading (W4970) within the rental window, load securement (W4972), the customer departure, and the rental return (VS-162); handle delays/extensions (links VS-162)
Responsible (R): Loading Supervisor / Self-Haul Rental
Accountable (A): Supervisor
Duration: Per pickup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4968_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4968_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4968_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4968_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4968_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-743 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Pickup &amp; Will-Call Program Design, Capacity &amp; Scheduling (PA-171.1).) | - CTL-743: rental linked to order; vehicle suitability verified; load securement checked (W4972); rental window managed
Owner: Loading-Zone Supervisor / Self-Haul Rental (VS-162) / Store Ops</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
